                        <td valign="top" width="24">1.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">The funds appropriated in this item shall be used only to support rehabilitation programs for incarcerated and supervised
                              individuals. Any unspent funds at the end of the 2025–26 fiscal year shall revert to the General Fund.
                           </div>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="bottom" width="80"></td>
