                              mandates reimbursement process for the California Assessment of Student Performance and Progress, the English Language Proficiency
                              Assessments for
                              			 California, and the statewide pupil assessment system established pursuant to Chapter 489 of the Statutes of 2013. Local
                              educational agencies receiving funding from these schedules shall reduce their estimated and actual mandate reimbursement
                              claims by the amount of funding provided to them from these schedules.
