                        <td colspan="4" valign="top" width="264">
                           <div style="">Funding distributed to each LEA for reimbursement of services provided in the 2024–25 fiscal year for the Adults in Correctional
                              Facilities Program shall be limited to the amount received by the agency for services provided in the 2023–24 fiscal year,
                              increased by the percentage change determined and provided
