                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">8.</td>
                        <td colspan="5" valign="top" width="288">
                           <div style="">Funds appropriated in this item, unless otherwise specified, are available for the sole purpose of funding 2025–26 fiscal
                              year special education program costs and shall not be used to fund any prior year adjustments, claims, or costs.
                           </div>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="bottom" width="80"></td>
