                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">(d)</td>
                        <td colspan="4" valign="top" width="264">
                           <div style="">For the purposes of this item, “homeless” and “housing insecure” mean students who lack a fixed, regular, and adequate nighttime
                              residence. This includes students who
                              			 are:
                           </div>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="bottom" width="80"></td>
