                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">(1)</td>
                        <td colspan="3" valign="top" width="240">
                           <div style="">Not less than $13,234,000 is available to provide $0.91 per unit reimbursement to community college districts for the provision
