                           </div>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="bottom" width="80"></td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">(ii)</td>
                        <td colspan="3" valign="top" width="240">
                           <div style="">The provision of technical assistance, training, and short-term institutional research necessary to address existing or potential
                              accreditation deficiencies.
                           </div>
                        </td>
                        <td valign="bottom" width="80"></td>
                     </tr>
                     <tr>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24"></td>
                        <td valign="top" width="24">(b)</td>
                        <td colspan="4" valign="top" width="264">
                           <div style="">The Board of Governors of the
                              			 California Community Colleges may request an unsolicited review of a community college district if the board of governors
                              determines that there is an imminent threat to the fiscal integrity of the district as a result of fraud, misappropriation
                              of funds, or other illegal fiscal practices.
                           </div>
