                     		  requirements for any program, project, or function in the schedule of any item of appropriation in this act.
                  </div>
                  <div style="margin:0 0 1em 0;margin-left: 2.5em;">(C) Any remaining interest, after the allocations pursuant to paragraphs (A) and (B), shall be allocated as determined by the
